      "cooked": "<p>MigrantP,</p><p>I am currently playing a game with Legacy, GI Bunker, Ra, Wraith and the Visionary. At this point GIB, Wraith and the Visionary are all incapped.</p><p>On Legacy's turn, play a card, use Galvanize.</p><p>On GIB's turn, allow Legacy to use a power, Legacy uses Galvanize.</p><p>The game doesn't seem to allow Galvanize to stack. It only comes up as a single +1 in damage resolution.</p>",
